  "title": "Coast Guard, Navy rescue 4 missing male divers",
  "description": "The Coast Guard and Navy rescued four missing male divers 46 miles southeast of Cape Fear River, North Carolina on Aug. 14, 2023. A Coast Guard Air Station Elizabeth City HC-130 Hercules airplane crew spotted an SOS-strobe light and, using their FLIR system (Forward-Looking Infrared), were able to record the divers' being brought aboard the U.S. Navy Destroyer USS Porter (DDG 78). (U.S. Coast Guard Video by Air Station Elizabeth City)",
